我把這題做成「逐圖點選＋2n/n 判讀」的互動圖，重點看 **染色體條數**，不要被 X 形或棒狀外觀騙到。

genui{"app_block":{"language":"html","entrypoint":"index.html","bundle_version":1,"title":"果蠅染色體：甲乙丙丁逐圖判讀","variant":"artifact","icon":"study","content":"<div id="chromosome-app" class="w-full space-y-5 text-[var(--viz-text)]">
  <div class="viz-callout">
    <div class="font-medium">先固定基準：果蠅體細胞有 4 對染色體 → 2n = 8</div>
    <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">受精卵發育成完整個體主要靠有絲分裂，因此正常體細胞應維持 2n。判斷時先數染色體，不要只看 X 形或棒狀。</div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4" role="group" aria-label="選擇甲乙丙丁階段">
    <button type="button" data-stage="甲" class="stage-btn rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-left">
      <div class="font-medium">甲</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">8 條・已複製</div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-stage="乙" class="stage-btn rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-left">
      <div class="font-medium">乙</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">4 條・單套</div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-stage="丙" class="stage-btn rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-left">
      <div class="font-medium">丙</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">8 條・分離後</div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-stage="丁" class="stage-btn rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-left">
      <div class="font-medium">丁</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">4 條・單套</div>
    </button>
  </div>

  <section aria-labelledby="stage-title" class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <h2 id="stage-title" class="font-medium">甲階段</h2>
      <span id="ploidy-badge" class="viz-badge">2n = 8</span>
      <span id="appear-badge" class="viz-badge">有絲分裂可出現</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr]">
      <div>
        <svg id="cell-svg" viewBox="0 0 520 300" class="w-full" role="img" aria-label="染色體階段示意圖">
          <circle cx="260" cy="150" r="125" fill="var(--viz-panel)" stroke="var(--viz-border)" stroke-width="3"/>
          <g id="chromosomes" stroke="var(--viz-series-1)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"></g>
          <g id="centromeres" fill="var(--viz-accent)"></g>
        </svg>
        <p id="visual-note" class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">甲的染色體雖呈 X 狀，但每個 X 仍算 1 條染色體；總數仍是 8 條。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">染色體條數</div>
          <div id="count-value" class="viz-stat-value">8</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">染色體套數</div>
          <div id="ploidy-value" class="viz-stat-value">2n</div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">受精卵發育過程</div>
          <div id="possible-value" class="font-medium">會出現</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="explain" class="space-y-2 text-base" aria-live="polite">
      <p><strong>甲：</strong>DNA 已經複製，所以染色體呈 X 狀，但仍是 8 條、2n。</p>
      <p>有絲分裂前 DNA 會複製，因此受精卵發育過程中可以看到這種階段。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="border-t pt-4">
    <h3 class="font-medium">一秒判斷法</h3>
    <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="viz-node">
        <div class="font-medium">① 先數條數</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">8 條 → 2n 候選<br>4 條 → n 候選</div>
      </div>
      <div class="viz-node">
        <div class="font-medium">② 不要被形狀騙</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">一個 X 仍是 1 條染色體，只是有兩條姐妹染色分體。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="viz-node">
        <div class="font-medium">③ 看題目情境</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--viz-muted)]">受精卵 → 成體＝有絲分裂 → 2n 維持不變。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
